OL,3,GNEWSAThree pedestrians injured in
OL,4,Acollision near school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree pedestrians have been injured in
OL,7,Fa collision with a vehicle near a
OL,8,Fschool.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said the incident
OL,11,Fhappened in Dee Road, Reading, at about
OL,12,F08:40 GMT. No one has been arrested.
OL,14,FIt said that none of those injured near
OL,15,Fthe English Martyrs' Catholic Primary
OL,16,FSchool were seriously hurt and they did
OL,17,Fnot need hospital treatment.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
