OL,3,GNEWSAThree pedestrians injured in
OL,4,Acollision near school
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlivia Bailey, MP for Reading West and
OL,7,FMid Berkshire, said she was "really
OL,8,Fconcerned" to hear of the incident. She
OL,9,Fadded that Reading Borough Council is
OL,10,Falready looking at measures to make Dee
OL,11,FRoad safer and that was "more important
OL,12,Fthan ever" now.
